# EMC chemistry file, written by scripts/make_emc_reference.py (reference: EMC typing and parameters).
#
# Prepare (from this directory):
#   emc.pl input.esh                              -> build.emc
#   emc_linux_x86_64 build.emc                    -> methyl_acetate.data, methyl_acetate.params
#
# Notes:
# - Columns are separated by tabs (EMC manual, Sec. 4.5.2).
# - No field_location: EMC uses its own PCFF files (EMC_ROOT/field/cff/pcff, the default field location).
# - Test molecule CC(=O)OC; about 600 atoms at 0.5 g/cc.

ITEM	OPTIONS

project	methyl_acetate
seed	2026

replace	true
build_dir	.
field	pcff
field_id	pcff
density	0.5
ntotal	600

ITEM	END

ITEM	GROUPS

methyl_acetate	CC(=O)OC

ITEM	END

ITEM	CLUSTERS

methyl_acetate	methyl_acetate	1

ITEM	END
